TI  - Discovery of a Marine Beauveria bassiana Polysaccharide with Antiviral Activity Against Tobacco Mosaic Virus
AN  - 41590736
DO  - 10.3390/md24010039
IS  - 1
VL  - 24
DA  - 2026/01
PY  - 2026
T2  - Marine drugs
